---
const snippets = [
  {
    idx: '01',
    title: 'Rebuildable index',
    code: `remember(text, evidence)
recall(query, { depth: 3 })
  .map(hit => hit.evidence)

forget(id)      // soft
restore(id)     // undo
rebuild_index() // derived only`,
    note: 'Every index is downstream of the canonical model, so a rebuild is a repair, not a rewrite of the truth.'
  },
  {
    idx: '02',
    title: 'Deterministic outfit',
    code: `const fit = harmony(palette)
  .with(proportions(garment))
  .score();

return fit[0]; // same input,
               // same answer`,
    note: 'Two identical wardrobes give two identical outfits. A model that guesses is not a stylist.'
  },
  {
    idx: '03',
    title: 'Approval gate',
    code: `if (action.risk === 'high') {
  await approve({ action, agent });
}
audit.record(action);`,
    note: 'Agents stop and ask before anything destructive, and the trail is written either way.'
  },
  {
    idx: '04',
    title: 'Crash-safe packet',
    code: `packet = compile(goal)
state = checkpoint(packet)

on crash: state.resume()`,
    note: 'The executive model plans; the local 30B does the work; the run survives its own hardware.'
  }
];
---

<section class="play" id="play">
  <div class="play__intro">
    <p class="play__kicker">04 &nbsp;/&nbsp; Playground</p>
    <h2 class="play__title">Small things I keep around to stay curious.</h2>
    <p class="play__note">
      Move your pointer over the grid. It's a shader, not a video, and it costs
      nothing when you're not touching it.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="play__run" data-rail>
    <div class="play__stage">
      <div data-pixel-trail aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="play__stage-label">Pointer field / shader</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rail">
      <div class="rail__track" data-rail-track>
        {
          snippets.map((snippet) => (
            <article class="snippet">
              <span class="snippet__idx">{snippet.idx}</span>
              <h3 class="snippet__title">{snippet.title}</h3>
              <pre class="snippet__code">{snippet.code}</pre>
              <p class="snippet__note">{snippet.note}</p>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
